+// START DRIVES (build 69): every drive's driver, whatever Storage's start modes say -- Off and Manual
+// included -- on the IO worker, so the browser keeps moving. No game list is started: the drivers
+// only. Storage looks exactly as it did when the browser closes (an Off drive's tab stays hidden, a
