+//   once on a console without one.
+//   iLink and MX4SIO: only when switched on in Game Sources. The iLink driver hangs the whole IOP on
+//   a console with no iLink controller (slim models; PCSX2 too, where this was found), and MX4SIO
+//   shares slot 2 and the controllers' bus. MX4SIO also stays out while a memory card is in slot 2.
+static void fbStartDrivesWork(void)
+{
+    DIR *d;
